      "procedure": "Glycerol and ethanol (96 per cent)-soluble substances: shake 1.000 g with 25 mL ethanol (96 per cent) for 1 min (W0); filter; weigh dry empty beaker (W1); evaporate filtrate on a water bath; dry residue at 70 °C for 1 h; weigh beaker with residue (W2). Residue = W2 - W1; Residue % = residue / W0 x 100 (maximum 0.5 %).",
