      "procedure": "Sulfates limit test (BP Appendix VII): 3 mL of 250 g/L barium chloride added to 4.5 mL sulfate standard solution (10 ppm SO4), shake, stand 1 min; 2.5 mL of this suspension with 15 mL solution S and 0.5 mL acetic acid (standard: 15 mL sulfate standard solution instead of S). After 5 min opalescence of the test not more intense than the standard (NMT 0.1 %).",
